WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:11.797
How to replace the servo: remove, center, install, teach, and test.

2
00:00:11.808 --> 00:00:21.147
Remove the old servo from the joystick restrictor gate.

3
00:00:21.159 --> 00:00:29.937
Unplug it only after noting the exact board pins.

4
00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:35.146
Detach the restrictor gate linkage from the old servo.

5
00:00:35.164 --> 00:00:40.925
Connect the new servo before installing it.

6
00:00:40.935 --> 00:00:48.736
Move the new servo to Center / 1500 microseconds.

7
00:00:48.743 --> 00:00:52.095
Install the servo arm while the servo is centered.

8
00:00:52.103 --> 00:00:58.136
Mount the servo into the joystick restrictor gate.

9
00:00:58.153 --> 00:01:01.955
Open the Calibration tab.

10
00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:07.276
Pos2 Default means released/out is the safe default.

11
00:01:07.289 --> 00:01:13.166
Click Teach for the replaced servo.

12
00:01:13.178 --> 00:01:18.156
Set and save Pos2 for released/out.

13
00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:23.366
Set and save Pos1 for engaged/in.

14
00:01:23.378 --> 00:01:31.025
Test Pos1 and Pos2 before normal use.

15
00:01:31.038 --> 00:01:38.756
Finish at CIRCLE / ALL POS2.
